cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FLASHPOINT:2027 in teaching or academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "FLASHPOINT:2027: A Crisis-Origins Exercise"
abstract: "An interactive, branching crisis simulation for security and strategic studies seminars. Players take one of six seats (US President, NATO Secretary General, UK Prime Minister, Russian President, PRC Paramount Leader, UN Secretary-General) during a fictional July 2027 crisis spanning the Baltic, orbit and the Taiwan Strait."
type: software
